          "table": "250016b8",
          "key": "2e5c1e52",
          "text_raw": "The Esper Warder would like you to give the Warder in Cragstone at 32.2 N, 12.5 W his regards.\n\nThe Esper Warder told you, \\qI knew my friend the Miller was correct in sending you to me. You have proven yourself worthy of the Warders of Osteth's regard. Let me reward you with experience and this Glyph. The Menhir it allows access to will tell you a few secrets of this land's history. If you should pass on to Cragstone, please give a friend of mine my regards. She is watching over the city of Cragstone even now.\\q",
